OL,3,GNEWSACity traders' fears over Christmas
OL,4,AMarket 'rest day'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTuesday saw the shutters stay down on
OL,7,Fstalls at York's famous Christmas
OL,8,FMarket for its first ever "rest day" -
OL,9,Fbut independent traders at a nearby
OL,10,Fmarket which runs all year round have
OL,11,Fwarned there could be unintended
OL,12,Fconsequences if visitors stay away from
OL,13,Fthe city altogether due to the pause.
OL,15,FDesigned to improve accessibility for
OL,16,Fresidents and to allow Blue Badge
OL,17,Fholders to park in the city centre, the
OL,18,Fnew weekly rest day for the Christmas
OL,19,FMarket involves closing the festive
OL,20,Fstalls as part of a trial by City of
OL,21,FYork Council.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
PN,38702
