PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1794948957
OL,1,W5j 5Quzj#5w;jp%p05 jj#57+
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,.*,%%** %  -,** %-. (,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSACity traders' fears over Christmas
OL,4,AMarket 'rest day'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut Finlay Henderson-Howard, of
OL,7,FShambles Kitchen, in the daily outdoor
OL,8,FShambles Market, said he was "not sure"
OL,9,Fabout the rest day pilot and was
OL,10,Fconcerned about its impact on the wider
OL,11,Fcity centre.
OL,13,FHe explained that he had been expecting
OL,14,FTuesday to be much busier than normal
OL,15,Ffor the time of year, with people
OL,16,Fflocking to the city for a Christmas
OL,17,FMarket which was not open.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
